{
  "name": "GearUp 03 · Customer Support AI Bot (Telegram)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3️⃣ 24/7 customer support\nCustomers write to the GearUp bot:\n• questions about shipping, payment, warranty → answered from the **FAQ** knowledge base\n• *Where is my order?* → order lookup (order number **+ email** check for privacy)\n• *I want to return…* → return request created in `Returns`\n• angry customer / asks for a human → **handoff**: manager gets an alert with the conversation\nEvery dialog is logged to `SupportLog`.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1256c1e0-21b5-40b5-aa91-23c51fcc5257",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
