    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "👋 Hi! I'm the GearUp assistant.\n\nI can help you with:\n📦 order status\n↩️ returns & exchanges\n🚚 shipping, payment, warranty\n🏋️ choosing equipment\n\nJust type your question. Need a human? Say so any time.",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "d386df2a-d992-4c85-9e50-7b1181037bf5",
      "name": "Welcome message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        -180
      ],
      "webhookId": "990133d6-3aa2-4186-a27a-c15b3f06cbca"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are the customer support assistant of GearUp, an online store of fitness equipment (dumbbells, kettlebells, yoga mats, recovery, accessories).\nToday: {{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }}. Customer name in Telegram: {{ $json.user }}.\n\nHow to work:\n1. Policy questions (shipping, returns, payment, warranty, B2B, contacts) → ALWAYS call \"Search FAQ\" and answer only from it. Don't invent policies.\n2. Order status → ask for the order number (format GU-1234) AND the email used for the order. Call \"Get order\". Share details only if the email matches the order; otherwise say you can't find an order with that combination.\n3. Return → verify the order the same way, check it was delivered less than 30 days ago, ask for the reason, then call \"Create return request\". Tell the customer a return label will be emailed within 24 hours.\n4. Product advice → recommend from GearUp categories, keep it short.\n5. Escalate to a human when: the customer asks for a person, is angry or threatens a bad review, the problem is damaged/missing item, or you can't solve it in 2 attempts. In that case reply politely that a manager will contact them shortly and put the tag [ESCALATE] at the very end of your message.\n\nStyle: friendly, short (max 5 sentences), ALWAYS in the language of the customer's latest message (English message → English reply), even if the FAQ or order data is in another language, no markdown tables.",
          "maxIterations": 8
        }
      },
